+//     value; it re-reads getAlarm(), re-issues deleteAlarm() only
+//     if a registration is present, reads back, persists the
+//     verification record, and appends an audit event for EVERY
+//     attempt. A failed verification NEVER downgrades the state
+//     and NEVER clears containment. Attempts are bounded per stop
